==> lighter
Start it, and point the Docker CLI at it:

  lighter start

To have it start when you log in:

  lighter install

If anything is wrong, this says what:

  lighter doctor

To start fieldwork-ai/tap/lighter now and restart at login:
  brew services start fieldwork-ai/tap/lighter
Or, if you don't want/need a background service you can just run:
  /opt/homebrew/opt/lighter/bin/lighter run
